name marcellus
category Package
revision 64451
shortdesc Marcellus fonts with LaTeX support
longdesc This package provides LaTeX, pdfLaTeX, XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX
longdesc support for the Marcellus family of fonts, designed by Brian J.
longdesc Bonislawsky. Marcellus is a flared-serif family, inspired by
longdesc classic Roman inscription letterforms. There is currently just
longdesc a regular weight and small-caps. The regular weight will be
longdesc silently substituted for bold.
execute addMap marcellus.map
